#: klettres.cpp:166
msgid "Themes"
msgstr "Temes"

#: klettres.cpp:169
msgid "Select the theme"
msgstr "Seleiciona'l tema"

#: klettres.cpp:170
msgid ""
"Here you can change the theme for KLettres. A theme consists in the "
"background picture and the font color for the letter displayed."
msgstr ""
"Equí pue camudase'l tema de KLettres. Un tema ta formáu por una imaxe de "
"fondu y un color pa la lletra que s'amuesa."

#: klettres.cpp:173
msgid "Mode Kid"
msgstr "Mou neñu"

#: klettres.cpp:177
msgid ""
"If you are in the Grown-up mode, clicking on this button will set up the Kid "
"mode. The Kid mode has no menubar and the font is bigger in the statusbar."
msgstr ""
"Si tas en mou adultu, calcando nesti botón pasará al mou neñu. El mou neñu "
"nun tien barra de menú, y la fonte de la barra d'estáu ye mayor."

#: klettres.cpp:180
msgid "Mode Grown-up"
msgstr "Mou adultu"

#: klettres.cpp:184
msgid "The Grownup mode is the normal mode where you can see the menubar."
msgstr "El mou adultu ye'l mou normal nel que pue vese la barra de menú."

